This is Hidden Brain, I'm Shankar Vedantum. On a September evening in 2016, Terence Croucher's SUV stopped in the middle of a road in Tulsa, Oklahoma. A woman saw him step out of the car. The doors of the car were open, the engine was still running. The woman called 911. Officer Betty Shelby was on her way to an unrelated incident when the call came in. Terrence was 40, African-American, born and raised in Tulsa.
这里是《隐藏的大脑》，我是尚卡尔·韦丹塔姆。2016年9月的一个晚上，特伦斯·克劳彻的SUV停在俄克拉荷马州塔尔萨市的一条马路中间。一名女子看到他下车。车门开着，发动机还在运转。这名女子拨打了911。警官贝蒂·谢尔比在前往处理另一起无关事件的途中接到了这个报警电话。特伦斯40岁，非洲裔美国人，在塔尔萨出生并长大。

