that the public does not know. My mother is an incredible, supportive, loving and caring woman. She is a wife, a mother, and a grand mother, with a heart of gold. She has always fought for the underdog and stands up for the week. And so it went with accusations against and defenses 4, the person who pulled the trigger and the person who got shot. Betty Shelby was recently acquitted of manslaughter charges. Still, the tenor of the back and forth, the psychological accusations and psychological
公众并不了解的一面。我的母亲是一个不可思议的、支持人的、充满爱心和关怀的女性。她是一位妻子、一位母亲、一位拥有金子般心的祖母。她总是为弱势群体战斗，为软弱者挺身而出。针对扣动扳机的人和遭到枪击的人的指控与辩护就这样展开了。贝蒂·谢尔比最近被判过失杀人罪名不成立。尽管如此，这种来回争论的基调、心理上的指控以及心理上的

