the country were wondering about was was he shot because he was black. At the time, Joshua was starting graduate school. I took that question pretty seriously, and we tried to figure out how we could test it in a laboratory. Joshua and his colleagues eventually developed a video game. It was a pretty bad video game, but it did the trick. It's more like a slideshow where there are a series of backgrounds that pop up on the screen, and then in one of those critical backgrounds, a person will suddenly appear. So we've got photographs of, say, 25 or so white men and 25 black men,
当时，约书亚刚开始读研究生。我非常认真地对待这个问题，我们试图找出如何在实验室里对其进行测试的方法。约书亚和他的同事最终开发了一个电子游戏。这是一个相当糟糕的电子游戏，但它确实达到了目的。它更像是一个幻灯片放映，屏幕上会弹出一系列背景，然后其中一个关键背景中会突然出现一个人。所以我们有大约25个白人男性和25个黑人男性的照片，

