00:30:26.000 --> 00:30:55.000
to their implicit biases. There is the potential to control it, right? The performance of the regular police officers, or even people that we train in our lab, suggests that people don't have to succumb to those stereotypic influences. They can exert control in certain circumstances. Maserine Banaji has a similar solution. She thinks we need more of what she calls in the moment reminders.
针对他们的内隐偏见。这其实是有可能控制的，对吧？普通警察的表现，甚至我们在实验室里训练的人的表现，都表明人们不必屈服于那些刻板印象的影响。他们在某些情况下是可以进行控制的。玛扎琳·巴纳吉（Mahzarin Banaji）也有类似的解决方案。她认为我们需要更多她所说的“即时提醒”。

