00:31:58.000 --> 00:32:20.000
to stop for a second to make a decision consciously and deliberately, instead of quickly and automatically, this can reduce the effects of implicit bias. Psychology has spent many years understanding the behavior of individuals, but tools such as the IAT might give us away to understand communities as a whole, maybe even countries as a whole.
